# Pairs with RestoreConverges, under the fairness Spec asserts. Global
# completion resumes shipping but not receiving, so a post-restore write never
# reaches the peer and the clusters stay apart for good. Every safety
# invariant holds.
MODULE: RestoreConvergesResumeLeavesReceivePaused
TARGET: RestoreConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the resume lifts the shipping pause but not the receive pause
PERTURBS: Resume

--- FIND
    /\ recvOn' = [recvOn EXCEPT ![c] = TRUE]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, data, log, bound, sent, rphase, vote, pre, post>>
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: receive stays paused.
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, data, log, bound, sent, rphase, vote, pre, post, recvOn>>
--- END
